    {
      "name": "recommend_service",
      "description": "Answers, by fixed published rules (/api/recommend/rules), whether the open answer already solves the person’s task or a paid personal analysis would add something. Returns the open tools to use, and when a paid analysis helps: product, real price in EUR, billing, outcome, limits, data freshness and a link where the person buys it on the website (prefilled with the household when a profile is given). Agents never pay and are never asked to. Use cases: residence-choice, career-planning, relocation-prep, return-to-russia, household-finance, education, housing-affordability, entrepreneurship, regional-economy, research-demography, international-mobility, life-trajectories.",
